Expense Tracker:
Application that let us to track the expenses and Savings and
credits of every user of the Application

Users:
Anyone who can signup into the application can able to track his or her expenses.

Features 1:
1. Track Expense
2. Track credits
3. Track Expense Type
4. Track Credit Type
5. Track payment type

Expense Purpose:
1. Food
2. Entertainment
3. Shopping
4. Eating out
5. Gifts
6. Gas/Fuel
7. EMI/Loan
8. Miscillaneous

Note: This should be stored in the DB

Expense/Credit Medium:
1. Bank Transaction 
2. UPI
3. Credit Card
4. Cash
5. Cashback

Note: This should be stored in the DB

Database Designing:

DB Type:
MongoDB

DB Entities:
1. UserAccount
2. Transaction
3. Purpose
4. Medium

Schema Design:

Purpose:
id
title
description
createdAt
updateAt

Medium:
id
title
description
createdAt
updateAt

Expense:
id
title
description
purpose
medium
amount
type - Credit or Debit

Account:
id
firstname
lastname
email
contactnumber
password (Hashed)
subscription
createdAt
updatedAt
